Zarel <nospam@mailinator.com> wrote:
> Um... I thought any weapon could be safely enchanted to +7; why is MB so 
> special in this way?

	MB can still be enchanted like the others, but the special effects
that it may do change depending on how high it's enchanted, and they're
often believed to be best at +2.  The "standard" recommended enchantment
for a long time was +2, but public opinion seems to be swinging in the
direction of just enchanting MB as high as you can, since the special
effects aren't all _that_ important anyway, especially when compared to
the extra damage.  Cancellation is the only really good one, but even at
best it only happens 10% of the time, and a lot of monsters don't have
anything worth cancelling anyway.  See
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/art2-343.html
which still recommends +2.

